{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in東京(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レポしますよー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず私服!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.やっぱりーいい加減ぴんく着るだろ？おめーぴんく好きなんだろ？くたばれー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.さすがにぴんく要素は取り入れつつ、くろ着ましょうくろ。もう16歳ですし？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちでしょう(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめきゅんのみなさんならわかるよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの趣味とか好きなものとか知ってるでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「1ーっ!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「2ーっ!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て叫んだ方から正解を見てくださいこちらっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/16/5855357/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/16/5855357/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいーきたこれ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏だもん。ゆかたー＼(∀)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先取りしすぎじゃん？とかゆー意見もたくさんあったけど、んなことないよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島人は６月から浴衣着るの!いいでしょもう夏なんだし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなんだか好評だったみたいです(*^^*)よかったよかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひめたんリボン封印したしね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くろ。文字をくろにしても伝わらないよ...ね。ああ遺憾だわ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はほんまー楽しかった(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に２部はいっぱい握手した感。ぼーっとする時間まったくなかったもん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました♪やっぱりひめたん個握好きよんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の名古屋も頑張ります＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は短くてごめんね。なき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/16/5855357/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんビームは薄目にすると やっぱり出力落ちるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー確かに、いっぱい目を開いた方がより強力かもね(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな気がするよ。根拠はないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/16/5855357/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別の私服はどうやって決めてる？その日の気分？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーそれだと迷うから、ちょっと前から悩む('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/16/5855357/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で心がけてることは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「握手会はスポーツ」というらりん(永島聖羅chan)の名言がありますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまにその通りだと思う(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の日は早く寝なきゃーとか、忘れ物しないようにーとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと精一杯楽しむことも大事。それいっちゃん大事!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}